#: 3d0d97ac6a72447794c9ee2e742b5f33
msgid ":ref:`MNT1_YAW_MAX <MNT1_YAW_MAX>` to 170"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-caddx-gimbal.rst:46
#: 52533235874745d3873633841363d99c
msgid ":ref:`MNT1_RC_RATE <MNT1_RC_RATE>` to 60 (deg/s) to control speed of gimbal when using RC targeting if controlling the movement RATE by RC is desired. If RC value is intended to control the ANGLE, then set it to 0."
msgstr ""

